      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MYSTERY FLIGHT (4) ran a nice race on debut to hit the frame then broke through last time by 1.3 lengths (19.95) at this track over 342m. Looks the one to beat. SIMBA ROSE (2) has been in the placings at his last two runs, most recently when third (23.46) in a Grade 6 over 400m at Gawler. Expecting significant improvement this line-up. CANYA KATSU (8) finds it hard to win. Finished third (20.02) at this track latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Has never missed the frame here at the trip from three starts. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Expected to feature. BEN LIKES SCOTCH (6) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at his latest outing at this circuit.",
